1422
00:59:00.600 --> 00:59:01.480
Hello, Esmeralda.
你好，埃斯梅拉达。

1423
00:59:02.420 --> 00:59:07.660
It's me, Josh Holloway from Lost, Yellowstone, and that underseen show Colony.
我是我，演过《迷失》、《黄石》以及那部被严重低估的剧集《殖民地》的乔什·霍洛威。

1424
00:59:07.900 --> 00:59:13.860
Anyway, your coworker, Nicole, bought this for you on Cameo so you could hear it from me.
总之，你的同事妮可花了钱在卡梅奥上买下这个，好让你能亲耳听到我这么说。

1425
00:59:15.140 --> 00:59:16.440
I'm not Jarson.
我不是贾森。

1426
00:59:17.160 --> 00:59:18.220
I'm Josh Holloway.
我是乔什·霍洛威。

1427
00:59:18.820 --> 00:59:20.160
I'm not your boyfriend.
我不是你男朋友。

1428
00:59:20.720 --> 00:59:22.380
I don't know how our wires got crossed.
我不知道我们俩是怎么搞混的。

1429
00:59:22.480 --> 00:59:24.120
I just say what they tell me to say on here.
我只是照着他们让我在这里说的话念而已。

1430
00:59:24.420 --> 00:59:26.040
But we're not in love.
但我们并没有相爱。

1431
00:59:26.660 --> 00:59:28.240
I'm in love with my wife, Jessica.
我爱的人是我妻子杰西卡。

1432
00:59:29.420 --> 00:59:30.180
I'm sorry.
我很抱歉。

1433
00:59:30.800 --> 00:59:31.160
Mahalo.
马哈洛。

1434
00:59:33.200 --> 00:59:37.160
I did love that the camera quickly panned to Oscar when he said mahalo.
我特别喜欢当他说出“马哈洛”时，镜头迅速扫向奥斯卡的那个画面。

1435
00:59:37.480 --> 00:59:37.880
Yeah.
是的。

1436
00:59:38.540 --> 00:59:39.660
Oscar's like, I knew it.
奥斯卡一副“我就知道”的表情。

1437
00:59:39.680 --> 00:59:40.200
I knew it.
“我就知道。”

1438
00:59:41.560 --> 00:59:44.740
Esmeralda is just visibly shaken by this.
埃斯梅拉达对此显然受到了极大的打击。

1439
00:59:44.800 --> 00:59:45.800
She is convinced.
她坚信不疑。

1440
00:59:46.020 --> 00:59:46.520
Thank God.
谢天谢地。

1441
00:59:46.960 --> 00:59:47.960
She's like, oh.
她当时就像是，哦。

1442
00:59:48.520 --> 00:59:48.780
Yeah.
没错。

1443
00:59:48.780 --> 00:59:50.800
And she's humiliated.
而且她感到受到了羞辱。

1444
00:59:51.020 --> 00:59:51.200
Yeah.
是的。

1445
00:59:51.940 --> 00:59:55.720
And this episode is going to end with Esmeralda up on the roof.
这一集的结尾将是埃斯梅拉达来到屋顶上。

1446
00:59:55.920 --> 00:59:56.920
She's watching LoSt.
她在看《迷失》。

1447
00:59:57.240 --> 00:59:58.180
And cursing.
并且在骂人。

1448
00:59:58.340 --> 01:00:00.020
She's saying a bunch of stuff in Italian.
她嘴里叽里咕噜说了一大堆意大利语。

1449
01:00:00.200 --> 01:00:02.120
I don't know what, but she's not happy.
我不知道具体在说什么，但她显然很不高兴。

1450
01:00:02.480 --> 01:00:02.780
Yeah.
对啊。

1451
01:00:03.080 --> 01:00:04.400
And Ned is going to go up there.
而内德会走过去。

1452
01:00:04.540 --> 01:00:05.980
He's going to say, I'm really sorry.
他会说，我真的很抱歉。

1453
01:00:06.860 --> 01:00:09.380
He might also drop a Lost spoiler.
他甚至还可能剧透一下《迷失》。

1454
01:00:10.300 --> 01:00:14.240
Maybe we won't say it in case you guys haven't watched LoSt.
也许我们就不说了，万一你们还没看《迷失》呢。

1455
01:00:14.240 --> 01:00:16.720
And then he gives her a huge hug.
然后他给了她一个大大的拥抱。

1456
01:00:17.100 --> 01:00:17.320
Yeah.
对。

1457
01:00:17.540 --> 01:00:18.660
And he says, you know what?
他说，你知道吗？

1458
01:00:18.660 --> 01:00:22.160
We're going to run the story, but we're not going to expose Esmeralda.
我们要把这篇报道做出来，但我们不会曝光埃斯梅拉达。

1459
01:00:22.320 --> 01:00:23.260
We're going to leave her out of it.
我们不会把她牵扯进来。

1460
01:00:23.340 --> 01:00:24.220
We're going to protect her.
我们要保护她。

1461
01:00:24.320 --> 01:00:25.940
He says, the award can wait.
他说，奖项可以等。

1462
01:00:26.100 --> 01:00:27.240
And there you have it.
事情就是这样。

1463
01:00:27.360 --> 01:00:28.580
Very touching moment.
非常感人的时刻。

1464
01:00:29.760 --> 01:00:32.420
And Mare really did help him with his profile.
而梅尔确实帮他写了人物专访。

1465
01:00:32.420 --> 01:00:36.720
So much so, he got asked out, which seems to bump Mare.
不仅如此，他还被人约出去了，这似乎让梅尔有点不高兴。

1466
01:00:36.960 --> 01:00:38.900
But then he doesn't go out with the lady.
但后来他并没有跟那位女士去约会。

1467
01:00:39.220 --> 01:00:39.620
No.
没有。

1468
01:00:40.000 --> 01:00:41.340
He says he's busy.
他说他很忙。

1469
01:00:41.580 --> 01:00:41.800
Yeah.
对。

1470
01:00:42.020 --> 01:00:44.100
He actually, I believe he says he doesn't like pizza.
事实上，我相信他说的是他不喜欢披萨。

1471
01:00:44.240 --> 01:00:45.440
She invites him to pizza.
她邀请他去吃披萨。

1472
01:00:45.540 --> 01:00:46.160
He's like, no.
他却说，不。

1473
01:00:46.540 --> 01:00:48.920
I think there's more coming up for Mare and Ned.
我觉得梅尔和内德后面还会有更多故事。

1474
01:00:48.920 --> 01:00:51.420
I'm just going to say, I did jump ahead.
我只想说，我确实提前看过了。

1475
01:00:51.860 --> 01:00:53.120
I've watched the next two.
我已经把接下来两集看完了。

1476
01:00:53.360 --> 01:00:53.680
Oh.
哦。

1477
01:00:53.980 --> 01:00:54.160
Yeah.
对。

1478
01:00:54.360 --> 01:00:55.320
You're ahead of me.
你进度比我快。

1479
01:00:55.580 --> 01:00:56.920
It's getting good there.
那里的剧情越来越精彩了。

1480
01:00:56.960 --> 01:00:57.320
Really?
真的吗？

1481
01:00:57.440 --> 01:00:57.840
Yes.
是的。

1482
01:00:57.980 --> 01:00:58.360
Okay.
好吧。

1483
01:00:58.480 --> 01:01:01.900
I'm like rooting for something that I hope happens in the finale.
我正盼着某件我希望能在季终集发生的事情成真呢。

1484
01:01:02.040 --> 01:01:03.100
We'll get to it, you guys.
我们待会儿会聊到这个的，大家伙儿。

1485
01:01:03.340 --> 01:01:07.260
We want to give a big thank you to Mo Welch for chatting with us about this episode.
我们要向莫·韦尔奇表示诚挚的感谢，感谢她跟我们一起聊这一集。

1486
01:01:07.260 --> 01:01:11.060
I did ask her if we're going to see more of Kimberly in season two.
我确实问过她，我们在第二季里还会不会看到更多金伯莉的戏份。

1487
01:01:11.060 --> 01:01:15.380
And she said, yes, Kimbo is back for more in season two.
她说，是的，金博在第二季里还会带来更多精彩表现。

1488
01:01:15.880 --> 01:01:16.660
Spoiler alert.
剧透警告。

1489
01:01:16.720 --> 01:01:18.360
She's going to be emotional.
她会情绪饱满。

1490
01:01:20.640 --> 01:01:22.360
I do look forward to that.
我确实很期待那个。

1491
01:01:22.460 --> 01:01:22.860
Me too.
我也是。

1492
01:01:23.000 --> 01:01:26.580
She said, playing a toilet paper salesperson comes really naturally to me.
她说，扮演一个卫生纸推销员对我来说简直轻车熟路。

1493
01:01:27.260 --> 01:01:28.260
Cracked me up.
把我笑死了。

1494
01:01:28.260 --> 01:01:33.440
I also want to say thank you to Kathleen Felix Hager, the costume designer for this show.
我还想感谢本剧的服装设计师凯瑟琳·菲利克斯·黑格。

1495
01:01:33.640 --> 01:01:35.020
I loved all those details.
我喜欢所有这些细节。

1496
01:01:35.200 --> 01:01:38.700
And she said we can hit her up if we have any questions for the rest of the series.
她说接下来的剧集如果我们有什么问题都可以找她。

1497
01:01:38.920 --> 01:01:40.880
And also, thanks to all of you.
还有，谢谢你们所有人。

1498
01:01:41.240 --> 01:01:43.080
Please keep your letters coming.
请继续给我们写信。

1499
01:01:43.540 --> 01:01:44.600
Reach out to us.
联系我们。

1500
01:01:44.700 --> 01:01:46.360
You can go to officeladies.com.
你们可以访问 officeladies.com。

1501
01:01:46.440 --> 01:01:51.320
You can find the folders to submit a chit-chat question, to submit your around-the-town info,
你可以找到提交闲聊问题的文件夹，提交你身边的城镇信息的文件夹，

1502
01:01:51.320 --> 01:01:55.780
and also to send us any questions you might have about the paper.
以及向我们发送你对本报纸可能有任何疑问的文件夹。

1503
01:01:55.780 --> 01:01:58.680
We love hearing from you guys, and we hope you have a good one.
我们非常高兴听到你们的反馈，并希望你们过得愉快。

1504
01:01:58.820 --> 01:01:59.420
See you next week.
我们下周见。

1505
01:01:59.700 --> 01:02:07.230
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

1506
01:02:07.570 --> 01:02:12.610
Office Ladies is a presentation of Odyssey and is produced by Jenna Fisher and Angela Kinsey.
《办公室女士》是 Odyssey 的一档节目，由詹娜·费舍尔和安吉拉·金西制作。

1507
01:02:12.850 --> 01:02:15.210
Our executive producer is Cassie Jerkins.
我们的执行制片人是卡西·杰金斯。

1508
01:02:15.410 --> 01:02:17.470
Our audio engineer is Sam Kiefer.
我们的音频工程师是萨姆·基弗。

1509
01:02:17.750 --> 01:02:19.990
And our associate producer is Ainsley Bubbico.
我们的副制片人是英斯利·布比科。

1510
01:02:20.330 --> 01:02:22.910
Odyssey's executive producer is Leah Reese Dennis.
Odyssey 的执行制片人是莉亚·里斯·丹尼斯。

1511
01:02:23.370 --> 01:02:26.150
Office Ladies was mixed and mastered by Bill Schultz.
《办公室女士》由比尔·舒尔茨进行混音和母带处理。

1512
01:02:26.270 --> 01:02:29.130
Our theme song is Rubber Tree by Creed Bratton.
我们的主题曲是克里德·布拉顿创作的《Rubber Tree》。
